  "description": "In the shadow of ancient Rome’s ruthless political purges, Hadrian is a gentle soul who is too softhearted for his tyrannical father’s liking. Thus, he is given a martial instructor by the name of Tiberius, whom Hadrian falls deeply in love for. Blushing and eager, Hadrian surrenders himself completely, but behind his new lover’s seductive touch lies a dark secret: stripped of everything by the Consul’s brutal regime, Tiberius is weaponizing Hadrian’s innocence as an instrument of political vengeance. However, as Hadrian’s family is headed for its downfall, Tiberius also starts falling for the man he’s about to destroy… \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
